The portable C in the scenario palettes: what it is expected to show otherwise
than the original. A patch of harness/goldens/palettes.txt, see
harness/goldens.py: a line with - is the golden's, a line with + is what is
expected in its place.
Deviation: 10 of src/portable_c/DEVIATIONS.md
Why: the box of F10 names the program in its title and in its question, by a
name that is two letters shorter: the box is two cells narrower, a cell on
either side, and its shadow ends a cell further left. In black and white and
on a laptop's display the box is in the colours of the panel and has no shadow
that shows: only its frame and its lines differ

